  "table_id": "Table_S14",
  "display_number": "S14",
  "title": "Supplementary Table S14. LightGBM predicted BAA-difference distribution by age group and exposure pattern under the joint scenario",
  "panel": "",
  "panel_title": "",
  "notes_before": [],
  "notes_after": [
    "Note. Median, first quartile, third quartile and sample size are reported for LightGBM-predicted individual-level BAA differences under the joint descriptive scenario (N = 5,914 observations). Values are the predicted BAA reduction (current prediction minus joint-scenario prediction); positive values indicate lower predicted BAA under the scenario. The model had negligible held-out explained variance (R² = 0.0045); contrasts are descriptive model outputs and do not estimate causal intervention effects. A participant-level re-evaluation found no out-of-sample predictive skill (held-out test R² = -0.013; Supplementary Note on predictive analyses and Supplementary Table S30).",
    "Abbreviations: BAA, biological age acceleration; EVI, enhanced vegetation index; LightGBM, light gradient boosting machine; O₃, ozone."
  ],
